### VULN-025 — server auth-handoff open redirect (raw HTTP 3xx, no browser needed)
GET http://localhost:21527/api/auth/login-link?token=<VALID>&redirect=//evil.example/phish HTTP/1.1
Host: localhost:21527
(no Origin — simulates a cross-site top-level navigation)

### client sinks accept the same payload:
GET http://localhost:21526/login?redirect=//evil.example/phish
GET http://localhost:21526/signup?redirect=//evil.example/phish
